---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, "")}/`;
---
<section class="home-section">
  <header>
    <p class="technical-kicker">04 · Documentation</p>
    <h2>Everything underneath is inspectable.</h2>
    <p>
      Start from the working endpoint, then move down through routing, runtime behavior,
      operations, interfaces, and the exact build output.
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="technical-index">
    <a href={`${base}getting-started/`}>
      <small>START HERE · 5 GUIDES</small>
      <strong>Getting started</strong>
      <p>Install Hoplite, create the starter application, select a profile, and run it.</p>
      <span>Open section →</span>
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}concepts/applications-resources/`}>
      <small>SYSTEM MODEL · 4 TOPICS</small>
      <strong>Concepts</strong>
      <p>Understand immutable resources, request values, capabilities, and worker-local state.</p>
      <span>Open section →</span>
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}guides/writing-web-services/`}>
      <small>OPERATIONS · 8 GUIDES</small>
      <strong>Guides</strong>
      <p>Build services, then follow routing, async handlers, authentication, OpenAPI, packaging, and production.</p>
      <span>Open section →</span>
    </a>
    <a href={`${base}reference/cli/`}>
      <small>INTERFACES · 8 REFERENCES</small>
      <strong>Reference</strong>
      <p>Look up the CLI and every visible core, authentication, host, development, and internal form.</p>
      <span>Open section →</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
